<h3>About Virtual Microscope Projects</h3>
<p>The Human Anatomy and Physiology Project provides students with a virtual microscope that allows them to view specimens relevant to A&P course content and enables them to practice practical laboratory skills such as focusing slides, viewing under different magnifications and altering available light.

Phase two offer a downloadable Virtual Microscope with an extended slide box that will include images utilized in additional courses. After downloading the microscope, the user can customize their own "slide box" to meet their learning objectives based on a bank of existing slides.</p>
